Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::SecondaryBootDiskUpdateStrategy>)

Secondary boot disk update strategy.

=item * C<< $msg->gpu_direct_config() >> / C<< $msg->gpu_direct_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::GPUDirectConfig>)

The configuration for GPU Direct

=item * C<< $msg->max_run_duration() >> / C<< $msg->max_run_duration($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Protobuf::Duration::Duration>)

The maximum duration for the nodes to exist.
If unspecified, the nodes can exist indefinitely.

=item * C<< $msg->local_ssd_encryption_mode() >> / C<< $msg->local_ssd_encryption_mode($value) >>

Type: C<Enum> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::NodeConfig::LocalSsdEncryptionMode>)

Specifies which method should be used for encrypting the
Local SSDs attached to the node.

