Configuration for Shielded Nodes.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_cost_management_config() >> / C<< $msg->desired_cost_management_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::CostManagementConfig>)

The desired configuration for the fine-grained cost management feature.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_master() >> / C<< $msg->desired_master($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::Master>)

