=item * C<< $msg->desired_dns_config() >> / C<< $msg->desired_dns_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::DNSConfig>)

DNSConfig contains clusterDNS config for this cluster.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_service_external_ips_config() >> / C<< $msg->desired_service_external_ips_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::ServiceExternalIPsConfig>)

ServiceExternalIPsConfig specifies the config for the use of Services with
ExternalIPs field.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_authenticator_groups_config() >> / C<< $msg->desired_authenticator_groups_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::AuthenticatorGroupsConfig>)

AuthenticatorGroupsConfig specifies the config for the cluster security
groups settings.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_logging_config() >> / C<< $msg->desired_logging_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::LoggingConfig>)

The desired logging configuration.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_monitoring_config() >> / C<< $msg->desired_monitoring_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::MonitoringConfig>)

The desired monitoring configuration.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_identity_service_config() >> / C<< $msg->desired_identity_service_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::IdentityServiceConfig>)

The desired Identity Service component configuration.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_enable_private_endpoint() >> / C<< $msg->desired_enable_private_endpoint($value) >>

Type: C<Bool>

Enable/Disable private endpoint for the cluster's master.

Deprecated: Use
desired_control_plane_endpoints_config.ip_endpoints_config.enable_public_endpoint
instead. Note that the value of enable_public_endpoint is reversed: if
enable_private_endpoint is false, then enable_public_endpoint will be true.

=item * C<< $msg->desired_default_enable_private_nodes() >> / C<< $msg->desired_default_enable_private_nodes($value) >>

