=item * C<< $msg->desired_control_plane_endpoints_config() >> / C<< $msg->desired_control_plane_endpoints_config($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::ControlPlaneEndpointsConfig>)

[Control plane
endpoints][google.container.v1beta1.Cluster.control_plane_endpoints_config]
