=item * C<< $msg->release_channel() >> / C<< $msg->release_channel($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::ReleaseChannel>)

The release channel of the version. If empty, it means a non-channel
release.

=item * C<< $msg->resource() >> / C<< $msg->resource($value) >>

Type: C<String>

Optional relative path to the resource. For example, the relative path of
the node pool.

=item * C<< $msg->windows_versions() >> / C<< $msg->windows_versions($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Container::V1beta1::ClusterService::WindowsVersions>)

